    (property "Note" "The charger regulates from BELOW only -- 50 mA while the rail is under setpoint, nothing above it. Without this resistor ANY excursion above 100 V is permanent: three hold-cutoff recirculation events stack to 106.4 V and stay there." (id 5) (at 120.0 68.0 0)
